{"version":2,"slug":"first-conditional-made-easy-speak-english-clearly","videoId":"SmZ46il9JoM","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/SmZ46il9JoM","lang":"en","title":"First Conditional Made Easy — Speak English Clearly","category":"Vlog","channel":"Speak English with Bo's Slow English","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"I have a question for you."},{"start":2,"text":"Which sentence sounds better?"},{"start":5,"text":"Is it number one?"},{"start":7,"text":"If I study"},{"start":12,"text":"I will"},{"start":13,"text":"pass"},{"start":15,"text":"the test."},{"start":18,"text":"Or"},{"start":19,"text":"is it number two?"},{"start":21,"text":"If I study"},{"start":24,"text":"I would"},{"start":27,"text":"pass [snorts]"},{"start":28,"text":"the test."},{"start":31,"text":"So the difference here is will"},{"start":36,"text":"and would."},{"start":38,"text":"I'm going to let you think about it."},{"start":42,"text":"[music]"},{"start":45,"text":"Most learners will choose number one."},{"start":49,"text":"If I study, I will pass the test. Now"},{"start":54,"text":"why is this important? This grammar is"},{"start":58,"text":"very useful because native English"},{"start":61,"text":"speakers use it all the time. We use the"},{"start":65,"text":"first conditional to talk about"},{"start":69,"text":"the"},{"start":71,"text":"future."},{"start":73,"text":"Possible"},{"start":75,"text":"situations"},{"start":78,"text":"results"},{"start":81,"text":"plans"},{"start":82,"text":"consequences."},{"start":86,"text":"This grammar helps explain"},{"start":89,"text":"if this"},{"start":92,"text":"happens"},{"start":96,"text":"then"},{"start":98,"text":"this"},{"start":99,"text":"happens."},{"start":102,"text":"If you want to speak clearly about your"},{"start":106,"text":"future, your plans, and possible"},{"start":110,"text":"results, you need to know first"},{"start":113,"text":"conditional."},{"start":114,"text":"So what is first conditional?"},{"start":118,"text":"The"},{"start":120,"text":"first conditional"},{"start":123,"text":"is used"},{"start":126,"text":"for real"},{"start":128,"text":"and"},{"start":130,"text":"possible"},{"start":132,"text":"situations"},{"start":135,"text":"in the"},{"start":137,"text":"future."},{"start":139,"text":"This means"},{"start":141,"text":"maybe it will happen, maybe it will not"},{"start":144,"text":"happen, but it is possible. So for"},{"start":148,"text":"example, remember this"},{"start":152,"text":"Maybe I study."},{"start":154,"text":"Maybe I will not study, but it is"},{"start":157,"text":"possible. And if I do study, there will"},{"start":161,"text":"probably be a result. I will pass the"},{"start":165,"text":"test. So again, the first conditional"},{"start":168,"text":"talks about real and possible situations"},{"start":173,"text":"in the future"},{"start":175,"text":"and"},{"start":177,"text":"its results."},{"start":181,"text":"Now let's look at the structure."},{"start":184,"text":"If plus"},{"start":187,"text":"present"},{"start":189,"text":"simple"},{"start":192,"text":"will"},{"start":194,"text":"plus"},{"start":196,"text":"base verb."},{"start":199,"text":"Got it? So again, it's if"},{"start":203,"text":"plus"},{"start":205,"text":"present simple"},{"start":207,"text":"will plus base verb."},{"start":211,"text":"I'm going to write that first example"},{"start":214,"text":"down here so you can compare the"},{"start":217,"text":"structure with a true example sentence."},{"start":221,"text":"If I study, I will"},{"start":227,"text":"pass"},{"start":229,"text":"the test."},{"start":232,"text":"Now we're going to practice together. So"},{"start":235,"text":"I have some beginner sentences,"},{"start":239,"text":"I have some intermediate"},{"start":242,"text":"and I have some advanced."},{"start":245,"text":"Ready?"},{"start":247,"text":"Example number one for beginner."},{"start":251,"text":"If"},{"start":252,"text":"it rains"},{"start":255,"text":"we"},{"start":257,"text":"will"},{"start":260,"text":"stay"},{"start":262,"text":"home."},{"start":264,"text":"So if it rains, which is the cause"},{"start":269,"text":"we will stay home is the effect."},{"start":273,"text":"If this happens, this will happen."},{"start":276,"text":"Can we read that sentence together"},{"start":279,"text":"slowly?"},{"start":281,"text":"If it rains, we will stay home."},{"start":287,"text":"Now I will read it in my normal speed."},{"start":291,"text":"If it rains, we'll stay home."},{"start":293,"text":"What did you hear differently when I"},{"start":296,"text":"said it in my normal speed?"},{"start":300,"text":"I turned"},{"start":302,"text":"we will into"},{"start":305,"text":"we'll."},{"start":307,"text":"And this is a contraction."},{"start":312,"text":"We're going to see so many of these"},{"start":315,"text":"today, so don't worry if you are"},{"start":318,"text":"unfamiliar just yet."},{"start":321,"text":"Example number two."},{"start":324,"text":"If"},{"start":326,"text":"she"},{"start":327,"text":"eats"},{"start":329,"text":"too much"},{"start":332,"text":"she"},{"start":334,"text":"will"},{"start":335,"text":"feel"},{"start":336,"text":"sick."},{"start":338,"text":"So again, we see the if and we see will."},{"start":343,"text":"Now let's read this slowly."},{"start":347,"text":"If she eats too much, she will feel"},{"start":353,"text":"sick."},{"start":355,"text":"And here it is in my normal speed."},{"start":358,"text":"If she [snorts] eats too much, she'll"},{"start":360,"text":"feel sick."},{"start":362,"text":"Tell me what the contraction is here."},{"start":369,"text":"She'll."},{"start":371,"text":"So she plus will equals"},{"start":376,"text":"she'll."},{"start":377,"text":"And example three."},{"start":381,"text":"If he wakes"},{"start":385,"text":"up"},{"start":386,"text":"early"},{"start":389,"text":"he"},{"start":390,"text":"will"},{"start":392,"text":"go to work"},{"start":396,"text":"on time."},{"start":398,"text":"Now let's say that together slowly."},{"start":402,"text":"If he wakes up early"},{"start":406,"text":"he will go to work on time."},{"start":412,"text":"And here it is in my normal speed."},{"start":415,"text":"If he wakes up early, he'll go to work"},{"start":418,"text":"on time."},{"start":419,"text":"So my contraction is"},{"start":422,"text":"he plus will equals he'll."},{"start":427,"text":"He'll. He'll go to work on time."},{"start":430,"text":"Now notice something important."},{"start":433,"text":"The subjects are different."},{"start":436,"text":"It we, she, he, they."},{"start":442,"text":"So the first conditional is not just for"},{"start":446,"text":"I. We can use it with many different"},{"start":450,"text":"subjects."},{"start":452,"text":"Now let's go over some intermediate"},{"start":456,"text":"examples."},{"start":458,"text":"Number one."},{"start":460,"text":"If"},{"start":461,"text":"[snorts]"},{"start":461.6,"text":"people"},{"start":464,"text":"practice"},{"start":466,"text":"English"},{"start":469,"text":"every"},{"start":471,"text":"day"},{"start":473,"text":"they"},{"start":474,"text":"will"},{"start":476,"text":"Hmm."},{"start":477,"text":"What do you think will happen?"},{"start":480,"text":"They will"},{"start":482,"text":"improve."},{"start":485,"text":"Let's read this together."},{"start":487,"text":"If people practice English every day,"},{"start":492,"text":"they will improve."},{"start":495,"text":"And here it is in my normal speed."},{"start":498,"text":"If people practice English every day,"},{"start":500,"text":"they'll improve."},{"start":503,"text":"Where is the contraction?"},{"start":505,"text":"They plus will"},{"start":508,"text":"equals"},{"start":511,"text":"they'll."},{"start":513,"text":"Very good."},{"start":514,"text":"Example number two."},{"start":517,"text":"If she"},{"start":520,"text":"doesn't"},{"start":522,"text":"sleep"},{"start":524,"text":"enough"},{"start":525,"text":"she"},{"start":526,"text":"will"},{"start":528,"text":"be tired"},{"start":531,"text":"tomorrow."},{"start":533,"text":"So tomorrow is future and this is what"},{"start":536,"text":"will happen if she doesn't sleep enough"},{"start":541,"text":"today."},{"start":542,"text":"Let's read this together."},{"start":545,"text":"If she doesn't sleep enough"},{"start":549,"text":"she will be tired tomorrow."},{"start":553,"text":"If she doesn't sleep enough, she'll be"},{"start":555,"text":"tired tomorrow."},{"start":557,"text":"And what is the contraction?"},{"start":560,"text":"It's"},{"start":563,"text":"she'll."},{"start":565,"text":"Very good. And number three."},{"start":570,"text":"If"},{"start":572,"text":"we save"},{"start":575,"text":"enough"},{"start":576,"text":"money"},{"start":580,"text":"what could happen?"},{"start":582,"text":"We"},{"start":583,"text":"will"},{"start":585,"text":"travel"},{"start":588,"text":"next"},{"start":589,"text":"year."},{"start":592,"text":"And let's say it together."},{"start":594,"text":"If we save enough money,"},{"start":598,"text":"we will travel next year."},{"start":602,"text":"And we have a contraction here, which is"},{"start":606,"text":"will."},{"start":608,"text":"The first conditional is often about"},{"start":611,"text":"cause and effect. Cause means"},{"start":615,"text":"this"},{"start":617,"text":"thing"},{"start":619,"text":"happens"},{"start":621,"text":"first."},{"start":622,"text":"Effect"},{"start":624,"text":"means"},{"start":626,"text":"this"},{"start":627,"text":"is the result."},{"start":631,"text":"I know I've mentioned this before, but I"},{"start":634,"text":"would just like to reiterate,"},{"start":637,"text":"which means say it again. We can think"},{"start":640,"text":"about it like this."},{"start":642,"text":"If this"},{"start":644,"text":"happens, this"},{"start":647,"text":"is the result."},{"start":650,"text":"I know we've already started practicing"},{"start":653,"text":"our contractions,"},{"start":655,"text":"but I wanted to continue practicing just"},{"start":659,"text":"in case you need additional support with"},{"start":662,"text":"this."},{"start":664,"text":"I"},{"start":666,"text":"plus will"},{"start":668,"text":"is"},{"start":670,"text":"I'll."},{"start":671,"text":"You plus will"},{"start":675,"text":"is"},{"start":677,"text":"you'll."},{"start":679,"text":"He or she plus will"},{"start":683,"text":"is"},{"start":685,"text":"he'll"},{"start":687,"text":"or she'll."},{"start":691,"text":"We plus will"},{"start":694,"text":"is"},{"start":696,"text":"we'll."},{"start":698,"text":"They plus will is"},{"start":704,"text":"they'll."},{"start":706,"text":"It plus will"},{"start":709,"text":"is"},{"start":711,"text":"it'll."},{"start":713,"text":"That's a weird one."},{"start":715,"text":"So, remember contractions are very"},{"start":717,"text":"common in the first conditional. Now,"},{"start":721,"text":"let's continue on to more advanced"},{"start":725,"text":"examples. Ooh, this one is actually a"},{"start":728,"text":"little bit difficult."},{"start":731,"text":"If"},{"start":733,"text":"the"},{"start":734,"text":"company"},{"start":737,"text":"doesn't"},{"start":739,"text":"fix"},{"start":740,"text":"this"},{"start":742,"text":"issue,"},{"start":744,"text":"if the company doesn't fix this issue,"},{"start":748,"text":"what could happen?"},{"start":750,"text":"I'll tell you one thing that could"},{"start":753,"text":"happen."},{"start":755,"text":"The"},{"start":757,"text":"customers"},{"start":759,"text":"will"},{"start":761,"text":"leave."},{"start":763,"text":"So, let's read this together."},{"start":767,"text":"If the company doesn't fix this issue,"},{"start":773,"text":"the customers will leave."},{"start":776,"text":"There is not a contraction here."},{"start":780,"text":"Just because there is the word will, it"},{"start":785,"text":"doesn't mean that you will say"},{"start":787,"text":"customers'll."},{"start":789,"text":"Customers [clears throat and snorts]"},{"start":792,"text":"'ll"},{"start":793,"text":"is not going to work. So, in this case,"},{"start":797,"text":"you will say the word will fully."},{"start":801,"text":"Here's how the sentence sounds in my"},{"start":804,"text":"normal speed."},{"start":806,"text":"If the company doesn't fix this issue,"},{"start":808,"text":"the customers will leave."},{"start":810,"text":"Example number two."},{"start":813,"text":"If he keeps"},{"start":818,"text":"working"},{"start":820,"text":"like"},{"start":822,"text":"this,"},{"start":823,"text":"what could happen?"},{"start":828,"text":"There are two paths"},{"start":831,"text":"to the result of"},{"start":834,"text":"this sentence."},{"start":837,"text":"Path number one could be more of like a"},{"start":841,"text":"negative situation."},{"start":844,"text":"Path number two could be a positive"},{"start":847,"text":"situation. So, let's start with"},{"start":850,"text":"negative."},{"start":852,"text":"I'm going to say"},{"start":854,"text":"if he keeps working like this,"},{"start":858,"text":"he"},{"start":859,"text":"will"},{"start":861,"text":"burn"},{"start":862,"text":"out."},{"start":864,"text":"Or"},{"start":865,"text":"he'll"},{"start":866,"text":"burn out."},{"start":868,"text":"Burnout is a phrasal verb, which means"},{"start":872,"text":"that you work so hard that you crash and"},{"start":877,"text":"burn, and you have no energy left to do"},{"start":882,"text":"anything anymore."},{"start":884,"text":"So, this is negative. If he keeps"},{"start":888,"text":"working like this, this meaning so hard,"},{"start":893,"text":"he will burn out. He'll burn out."},{"start":896,"text":"Now, let's spin this so it's a positive"},{"start":900,"text":"sentence. So, 2.1."},{"start":905,"text":"If he keeps"},{"start":909,"text":"working"},{"start":911,"text":"like"},{"start":913,"text":"this,"},{"start":917,"text":"what would be a positive"},{"start":920,"text":"result to this?"},{"start":923,"text":"So, [snorts] remember in this sentence,"},{"start":926,"text":"the word this is implying"},{"start":930,"text":"or saying that he's working really hard."},{"start":935,"text":"So, sometimes there is a positive result"},{"start":940,"text":"to working very hard. And what I'm going"},{"start":944,"text":"to say is if he keeps working like this,"},{"start":949,"text":"he will"},{"start":951,"text":"or he'll"},{"start":954,"text":"accomplish"},{"start":957,"text":"his"},{"start":959,"text":"goal."},{"start":961,"text":"Yay, that's positive."},{"start":964,"text":"Now, let's read both of those together"},{"start":967,"text":"slowly."},{"start":969,"text":"If he keeps working like this, he will"},{"start":974,"text":"burn out."},{"start":976,"text":"I'll say it in my normal speed."},{"start":979,"text":"If he keeps working like this, he'll"},{"start":980,"text":"burn out."},{"start":982,"text":"Sentence 2.1."},{"start":984,"text":"If he keeps working like this, he will"},{"start":989,"text":"accomplish his goal."},{"start":992,"text":"If he keeps working like this, he'll"},{"start":993,"text":"accomplish his goal."},{"start":996,"text":"I want to talk about real English."},{"start":1000,"text":"So,"},{"start":1001,"text":"I just gave you the sentence structure"},{"start":1004,"text":"for first conditional using the word"},{"start":1007,"text":"will."},{"start":1008,"text":"But,"},{"start":1010,"text":"another way you might hear the first"},{"start":1013,"text":"conditional is instead of saying will,"},{"start":1017,"text":"we could say going to. So, let me give"},{"start":1020,"text":"you an example."},{"start":1022,"text":"If"},{"start":1023,"text":"you"},{"start":1025,"text":"keep"},{"start":1027,"text":"doing"},{"start":1028,"text":"that,"},{"start":1031,"text":"it's"},{"start":1032,"text":"going"},{"start":1034,"text":"to cause"},{"start":1036,"text":"problems."},{"start":1038,"text":"So, let's read this together."},{"start":1040,"text":"If you keep doing that,"},{"start":1044,"text":"it's going to cause problems."},{"start":1047,"text":"So, there's no"},{"start":1049,"text":"will"},{"start":1051,"text":"here."},{"start":1053,"text":"But, this is still an example of first"},{"start":1056,"text":"conditional."},{"start":1058,"text":"Here is the cause, and here is the"},{"start":1061,"text":"effect."},{"start":1063,"text":"But, in spoken English, when it's said"},{"start":1067,"text":"quickly, here's how it will sound."},{"start":1070,"text":"If you keep doing that, it's going to"},{"start":1072,"text":"cause problems."},{"start":1074,"text":"So,"},{"start":1076,"text":"I"},{"start":1078,"text":"turn this going to"},{"start":1080,"text":"to gonna."},{"start":1083,"text":"So, possible future situation plus the"},{"start":1086,"text":"result of it."},{"start":1088,"text":"All right, now it's your turn. And I"},{"start":1092,"text":"would love for you to leave your answers"},{"start":1096,"text":"in the comments section below. Here are"},{"start":1099,"text":"some fill-in-the-blank exercises."},{"start":1103,"text":"Number one."},{"start":1105,"text":"Blank,"},{"start":1108,"text":"I will"},{"start":1110,"text":"stay"},{"start":1112,"text":"home."},{"start":1114,"text":"So, what could [clears throat] happen"},{"start":1118,"text":"which will result in"},{"start":1121,"text":"you staying home?"},{"start":1124,"text":"Let me know."},{"start":1125,"text":"Number two."},{"start":1129,"text":"Blank,"},{"start":1130,"text":"she"},{"start":1132,"text":"will"},{"start":1133,"text":"feel"},{"start":1135,"text":"tired."},{"start":1137,"text":"Something might happen,"},{"start":1140,"text":"and it will cause her to feel tired if"},{"start":1144,"text":"that happens. And number three."},{"start":1148,"text":"If they [snorts]"},{"start":1151,"text":"leave"},{"start":1153,"text":"late,"},{"start":1155,"text":"what could happen?"},{"start":1158,"text":"Now, let's review, recap, and remember"},{"start":1163,"text":"everything that we discussed. Not"},{"start":1167,"text":"everything, just the basic stuff."},{"start":1170,"text":"The first conditional"},{"start":1173,"text":"is"},{"start":1175,"text":"used"},{"start":1176,"text":"for"},{"start":1177,"text":"real"},{"start":1179,"text":"and"},{"start":1180,"text":"possible"},{"start":1183,"text":"future"},{"start":1185,"text":"situations."},{"start":1188,"text":"Okay?"},{"start":1189,"text":"So, But sentence structure is if plus"},{"start":1196,"text":"present"},{"start":1197,"text":"simple"},{"start":1200,"text":"then"},{"start":1201,"text":"will"},{"start":1203,"text":"plus base"},{"start":1205,"text":"verb."},{"start":1206,"text":"If you want to talk about your results,"},{"start":1211,"text":"plans, or possible future situations in"},{"start":1216,"text":"English, the first conditional is very"},{"start":1220,"text":"important. This is the real English that"},{"start":1223,"text":"people use every day."},{"start":1226,"text":"So, practice these examples, shadow me,"},{"start":1230,"text":"say it out loud, talk to yourself in the"},{"start":1233,"text":"mirror. I hope you enjoyed this lesson"},{"start":1236,"text":"and learned a lot. And don't forget, I"},{"start":1239,"text":"started a new YouTube channel. It's for"},{"start":1243,"text":"kids and families and super beginner"},{"start":1247,"text":"English learners. So, if you haven't"},{"start":1249,"text":"checked that out, please do so. I really"},{"start":1253,"text":"appreciate all of your support, and I'll"},{"start":1255,"text":"see you next time. Bye."}]}